      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاشِرٌ</span></b>  One <i>who takes forth horses and camels to
the pasture-land, and remains there:</i> [see also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشَّارٌ</span>:] pl.<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُشَّارٌ</span>: (TA:) [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُشَّرٌ</span> is another
